msgid "Start face scan"
msgstr "Bilow iskaanka wejiga"

#: src/onboarding.py:559 src/onboarding.py:613
msgid "Scan face model"
msgstr "Sawirka qaabka wajiga"

#: src/onboarding.py:563
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Ma badbaadin karo qaabka wajiga"

#: src/onboarding.py:568 src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Sawir model labaad"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Waa la duubi waayay qaabka labaad"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. Make sure your"
" face is well lit and centred, then try again -- or skip and add a mod"
"el later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Moodeelkaagii ugu horreeyay waa la keydiyay, marka waji galitaanka aya"
"a horay u shaqeynayay. Hubi in wejigaagu si fiican u iftiimay oo dhexd"
"a u yahay, ka dibna isku day mar kale -- ama ka bood oo ku dar moodal "
"hadhow Settings."

#: src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Add a face model (required)"
msgstr "Ku dar qaabka wejiga (loo baahan yahay)"

#: src/onboarding.py:609
msgid ""
"Face login needs at least one face model, so this scan can't be skippe"
"d. Record it in the light you usually sit in. Lighting changes how you"
"r face looks to the camera, so consider adding a second model later fr"
"om Settings, recorded in different light (for example evening lamps in"
"stead of daylight)."
msgstr ""
"Gelitaanka wejigu wuxuu u baahan yahay ugu yaraan hal nooc oo weji ah,"
" markaa sawirkan lama dhaafi karo. Ku duub iftiinka aad inta badan ku "
"fadhido. Iftiinku wuxuu beddelaa sida wejigaagu u ekaado kamaradda, ma"
"rkaa ka fiirso inaad ku darto moodal labaad ka dib Settings, oo lagu d"
"uubay iftiin kala duwan (tusaale nalalka fiidkii halkii aad ka heli la"
"hayd iftiinka maalintii)."

#: src/onboarding.py:618
msgid "Add a second face model (recommended)"
msgstr "Ku dar qaab wejiga labaad (lagu taliyay)"

#: src/onboarding.py:620
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved. Lighting changes how your face looks to the"
" camera: a model recorded in daylight can fail in the evening under la"
"mps (or the other way round), and Ubuntu Hello then times out instead "
"of unlocking. A second model recorded in different light keeps recogni"
"tion reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Moodelkaaga ugu horreeya waa la keydiyay. Iftiinku wuxuu beddelaa sida"
" wejigaagu u eego kamaradda: moodeel lagu duubay iftiinka maalintii wu"
"xuu ku fashilmi karaa fiidka nalalka hoostooda (ama qaab kale oo waree"
"g ah), iyo Ubuntu Hello dabadeed waqtiyadu wuu baxayaa halkii laga fur"
"i lahaa. Qaabka labaad ee lagu duubay iftiin kala duwan wuxuu ilaaliya"
"a aqoonsiga wakhti kasta oo maalinta ah."

#: src/onboarding.py:622
msgid ""
"Change the lighting first: switch the room light or desk lamp on or of"
"f, turn away from the window, or put on the glasses you sometimes wear"
". Then look straight into the camera and press Scan."
msgstr ""
"Beddel nalka marka hore: daar nalka qolka ama laambadda miiska, ka lee"
"xi daaqadda, ama xidho muraayadaha aad mararka qaarkood xidhato. Kadib"
"na toos u eeg kamarada oo taabo Scan."

#: src/onboarding.py:660
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello Dejinta"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello waxay si toos ah u furi kartaa {} adiga oo isticmaalaya a"
"qoonsiga wajiga (boorsada la ogaaday: {}).\n\n<b>Habka TPM:</b> Hubint"
"a qalabka TPM iyo agabka..."

#: src/onboarding.py:693
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello waxay si toos ah u furi kartaa {} adiga oo isticmaalaya a"
"qoonsiga wajiga (boorsada la ogaaday: {}).\n\n<b>Habka TPM:</b> Qalabk"
"a TPM waa la helay. Ku rakibida <i>tpm2-tools</i> si toos ah..."

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello waxay si toos ah u furi kartaa {} adiga oo isticmaalaya a"
"qoonsiga wajiga (boorsada la ogaaday: {}).\n\n<b>Habka TPM:</b> Hardwa"
"re TPM 2.0 firfircoon. Furahaaga sirta ah ayaa si ammaan ah loogu xiri"
" doonaa gudaha TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello waxay si toos ah u furi kartaa {} adiga oo isticmaalaya a"
"qoonsiga wajiga (boorsada la ogaaday: {}).\n\n<b>Habka TPM:</b> Qalabk"
"a TPM waa la helay, laakiin si toos ah u rakibida <i>tpm2-tools</i> wu"
"u fashilmay. Ku orod <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Ku soo "
"noqoshada kaydinta aqoonsiga ku salaysan software."

#: src/onboarding.py:709
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello waxay si toos ah u furi kartaa {} adiga oo isticmaalaya a"
"qoonsiga wajiga (boorsada la ogaaday: {}).\n\n<b>Habka TPM:</b> Ma jir"
"o qalab TPM ah oo la ogaaday. Isticmaalka kaydinta aqoonsiga ku salays"
"an software (AES-256-GCM)."

