#: src/onboarding.glade:81
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing any"
"thing you would normally have to type your password for to authenticat"
"e, like running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unloc"
"k, your login keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically o"
"n login.\n\nYou can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to cha"
"nge more advanced settings or add additional models. Press Finish belo"
"w to close this window and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Waanu dhammaynay! Ubuntu Hello hadda wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa kumbuyuutarkan"
". Isku day inaad sameyso wax kasta oo aad caadiyan ku qasban tahay ina"
"ad ku qorto eraygaaga sirta ah si loo xaqiijiyo, sida ku socodsiinta a"
"marka sudo. Haddii aad karti u siiso furaha otomaatiga ah, furahaaga s"
"oo gelida ama KWallet sidoo kale si toos ah ayaa loo furayaa marka la "
"soo galo.\n\nWaxaad furi kartaa Ubuntu Hello Configurator ka dib si aa"
"d u bedesho goobo horumarsan oo dheeraad ah. Riix Finish hoos si aad u"
" xirto daaqadan oo aad u furto Ubuntu Hello Configurator."

#: src/onboarding.glade:129
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet us"
"ing face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello waxay si toos ah u furi kartaa furahaaga galida ama KWall"
"et adoo isticmaalaya aqoonsiga wejiga, ka hortagga furaha sirta ah ka "
"dib markaad gasho."

#: src/onboarding.glade:141
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Daar fur furidda tooska ah/KWallet"

#: src/onboarding.glade:183
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Xaqiiji erayga sirta ah"

#: src/onboarding.glade:215
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Dejinta siyaasad hubaal ah"

#: src/onboarding.glade:234
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match"
" is never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you "
"can set how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Isbadalada xagasha, fogaanta, iyo arimaha kale dartood isbarbardhiga w"
"eji marnaba lama mid aha qaabka wajiga kaydsan. Boggaan waxaad dejin k"
"artaa sida adag ee Ubuntu Hello ay tahay."

#: src/onboarding.glade:273
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Degdeg ah"

#: src/onboarding.glade:289
msgid ""
"Allows more fuzzy matches, \nbut speeds up the scanning process greatl"
"y."
msgstr ""
"Oggolow tartamo badan oo wareer badan, \nlaakiin aad buu u dedejiyaa h"
"awsha iskaanka."

#: src/onboarding.glade:328
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Isku dheeli tiran"

#: src/onboarding.glade:344
msgid ""
"Still relatively quick detection, \nbut might not log you in when furt"
"her away."
msgstr ""
"Wali ogaansho degdeg ah \nlaakiin waxaa laga yaabaa in uusan ku soo ga"
"lin marka aad fogaato."

#: src/onboarding.glade:383
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Ammaan"

#: src/onboarding.glade:399
msgid ""
"The slightly safer option, \nbut will take much longer to authenticate"
" you"
msgstr ""
"Doorashada wax yar ka badbaado badan, \nlaakiin waxay qaadan doontaa w"
"aqti dheer in lagu xaqiijiyo"

#: src/onboarding.glade:442
msgid "Adding a face model"
msgstr "Ku darida qaabka wejiga"

#: src/onboarding.glade:461
msgid ""
"To authenticate you Ubuntu Hello needs to save a model of your face to"
" recognise you. Press the Scan button below to start the facial scan."
msgstr ""
"Si loo xaqiijiyo adiga Ubuntu Hello waxay u baahan tahay inay kaydiso "
"qaabka wejigaaga si uu kuu aqoonsado. Riix badhanka Scan ee hoose si a"
"ad u bilowdo sawirka wajiga"

#: src/onboarding.glade:538
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Ka bood hadda"

#: src/onboarding.glade:544
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-"
"hello add"
msgstr ""
"Waxaad ku dari kartaa noocyo badan oo waji ah hadhow Settings ama waxa"
"ad ku dari kartaa: sudo ubuntu-hello add"

#: src/onboarding.glade:577 src/onboarding.glade:668
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Dejinta kamaradaha webka"

#: src/onboarding.glade:594
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "Emitter-ka infraredku miyuu biliglaynayaa?"

#: src/onboarding.glade:612
msgid "yes"
msgstr "haa"

#: src/onboarding.glade:629
msgid "no"
msgstr "maya"

#: src/onboarding.glade:687
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available c"
"ameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list "
"of usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and clic"
"k Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello waxay si toos ah uga baadhi doontaa nidaamkaaga kamarado "
"kasta oo la heli karo, markaa hubi in kamaraddaada shabakadu ku xidhan"
" tahay. Ka dib markii la ogaado liiska kamaradaha webka ee la isticmaa"
"li karo ayaa la tusi doonaa. Dooro midka aad rabto inaad isticmaasho o"
"o guji Next."

#: src/onboarding.glade:709
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Tijaabi kamaradahaaga mareegaha, fadlan sug..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:761
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Soo dejinta xogta faylasha"

#: src/onboarding.glade:780
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be"
" able to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the "
"download progress below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello waxay u baahan tahay saddex kayd oo hore u tababaran oo a"
"qoonsiga wajiga ah si ay awood ugu yeelato inay ku aqoonsato, kuwaas o"
"o hadda la soo dejin doono. Hoos waxaad ka arki kartaa horumarka downl"
"oad."

#: src/onboarding.glade:801
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Bilaabida soo dejinta"

#: src/onboarding.glade:850
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Ku soo dhawoow Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:866
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Nooca"

#: src/onboarding.glade:887
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Saaxirkan ayaa kugu socon doona habka dejinta oo si toos ah ayuu kuugu"
" habeyn doonaa Ubuntu Hello. Riix ku xiga si aad u sii wado"

#: src/onboarding.glade:911
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Jooji"

#: src/onboarding.glade:931
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Xiga"

#: src/onboarding.glade:956
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "dhame habaynta"

